The linkstation_defconfig taken from 2.6.30-rc3 is not up-to-date with
newer settings present in Linux 2.6.30-rc*, like the new filesystem
caching subsystem, the option of ext3 to use data=ordered, etc.

This patch updates it in a most conservative way.



Signed-off-by: Rogério Brito <rbrito@ime.usp.br>
